<title>Boards: diagrams and sketches</title>
<p>A board is a whiteboard inside your notes: boxes and arrows for a plan, a quick sketch, sticky notes for loose ideas. It is a port of Excalidraw, so boards open in excalidraw.com and its drawings paste into Quiet.md.</p>
